<title>CHINA: Deutsche Bank finalises bank warrants terms.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Bank finalises bank warrants terms.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Bank AG, London Branch, said on Friday it had finalised terms of an earlier issue of three billion American-style call warrants on a basket of bank stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises:</p>
<p> Union Bank of Hong Kong Ltd	    0.007 shrs</p>
<p> Ka Wah Bank Ltd			    0.014 shrs</p>
<p> Liu Chong Hing Bank			0.008 shrs</p>
<p> Hang Seng Bank			     0.004 shrs</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$0.90345    PREMIUM	 21.8 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.025487   GEARING	 3.7x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  15.JUN.98     PAYDATE	 02.SEPT.97</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG     LISTING DATE  04.SEPT.97</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$0.951	MIN EXER LOT  200,000</p>
<p> SETTLEMENT	  CASH SETTLEMENT OR PHYSICAL DELIVERY AT</p>
<p>			 ISSUER'S DISCRETION</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
